{
  "id": "u09-l08",
  "unit": "u09-past",
  "title": "Review: what happened?",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Quick check of the past system:\n\n- **simple past** (*did*): করলাম, করলে, করলেন, করল\n- **perfect** (*have done*): করেছি, খেয়েছেন\n- **negative** (*didn't / haven't*): present + **-নি**: করিনি, খাইনি\n- **was**: ছিলাম, ছিলে, ছিলেন, ছিল\n- **past perfect** (*had done*, recognise only): গিয়েছিলাম, গিয়েছিল\n\n**ছবি** means both 'picture' and 'film': **একটা ছবি দেখলাম** 'I watched a film'.\n\n**মতো** (*moto*) 'like, similar to' follows a genitive, just like সাথে: **মায়ের মতো** 'like (her) mother'. It's not the 'like' of liking food; that's **পছন্দ**.",
  "vocab": [
